       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "The Absolute URL for the resource.  The fullUrl SHALL NOT disagree with the id in the resource - i.e. if the fullUrl is not a urn:uuid, the URL shall be version-independent URL consistent with the Resource.id. The fullUrl is a version independent reference to the resource. The fullUrl element SHALL have a value except that: \n* fullUrl can be empty on a POST (although it does not need to when specifying a temporary id for reference in the bundle)\n* Results from operations might involve resources that are not identified." ] ;
